description.en:
This is a special formula that rejuvenates the skin, the gold collagen works on whiten and tighten the skin and gives feed and freshness for skin.
How to use;
After cleansing the face, avoiding the eye & lip contour parts, put a little thin layer mask to the face wait 15-25 minutes until the mask dry from the bottom to top peel it off, for best results use 2-3 time a week.

